{"parentUuid":"4c9412dd-9677-4675-869b-948256927282","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01AwwfsULyopC92JKZncnPBE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Build passes cleanly. Here's a summary of everything that was changed:\n\n---\n\n**Fix 1: UPI payment flow — no more page refresh data loss**\n\n- `handleOpenUpiApp` now uses an anchor element click (`a.click()`) instead of `window.location.href = 'upi://pay'`, which avoids triggering a browser navigation/reload.\n- When the UPI app launches, a `yff_upi_launched_v1` flag is saved to `localStorage`.\n- `upiScreen` state is persisted to `yff_upi_pending_v1` in `localStorage` whenever it's set.\n- A `visibilitychange` listener fires when the user switches back from the UPI app — if the launch flag is set, `triggerPostPayment` runs automatically (updates DB status + opens WhatsApp with full order details), no manual button tap needed.\n- On page mount (handles the reload case): if both `pending` and `launched` flags exist, the `CartFab` auto-opens and `CartSheet` auto-triggers the WhatsApp flow immediately.\n- Both flags are cleared after WhatsApp opens (or if the user switches to Cash on Pickup).\n- Closing the cart (× button) removes the `launched` flag so the auto-trigger doesn't fire spuriously on next open.\n\n**Fix 2: Z-index — cart modal always on top**\n\n- All three `CartSheet` render paths (main cart, UPI payment screen, success screen) changed from `z-50` to `z-[100]`.\n- The toast within the main cart is bumped to `z-[110]` so it stays above the modal.\n- `StickyBottomBar` (z-50) and the sticky tab bar (z-40) are now fully behind the modal overlay."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":545,"cache_read_input_tokens":88289,"output_tokens":419,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemera