{"parentUuid":"80896575-8e43-4df6-8c5a-c29f69d9c336","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a69473c5-3a2f-46c4-bbd6-2dbf38a727ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"[2:56 pm, 05/05/2026] Akhil Gpt: B. Severity Table\n\n  | Issue | Severity | Why it matters | File/location |\n  |---|---|---|---|\n  | Farmer dashboard auth bypass via localStorage | Critical | If the browser decides farmer identity, anyone can impersonate another farmer and read/act on\n  that farmer’s orders. Current repo appears fixed; original QA finding was valid. | projects/your_family_farmer/src/app/farmer/dashboard/page.tsx:133,\n  projects/your_family_farmer/src/app/api/farmer/dashboard/route.ts:7 |\n  | Direct browser writes to orders / payment state | Critical | Anonymous frontend writes let buyers or attackers create fake orders or mark payments\n  submitted without trusted validation. Current repo appears fixed; old flow was unsafe. | projects/your_family_farmer/src/components/consume…\n[2:59 pm, 05/05/2026] Akhil Gpt: Main points bro\n[2:59 pm, 05/05/2026] Akhil Gpt: * - Website: https://yourfamilyfarmer.6281400.xyz/\n  - This is YourFamilyFarmer consumer website\n  - It is meant for direct farmer-to-buyer ordering\n  - Payment model is supposed to be UPI Direct Payment\n      - Buyer pays farmer directly\n      - Platform should not collect money\n      - Farmer should manually verify payment\n  - Main issues on the live website:\n      - Security problem in farmer access flow\n          - Farmer-side access was not safely protected in the older implementation\n      - Orders/payment flow was too frontend-controlled\n          - Browser was doing too much directly with database/payment state\n      - Consumer order history privacy problem\n          - Live /consumer/orders still allows order lookup using only phone number input\n          - This is not private enough\n      - Manual UPI flow is not fully reliable on live\n          - Important payment-matching details were missing