{"parentUuid":"a47974ad-cbba-48dd-ba07-a3d7fe583adf","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"08e3ad66-be71-4575-bb27-6c695c35cd8b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"you saying that login for consumers ?"},"uuid":"a7e17912-c018-41f0-90b5-ebdb24f73bda","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:40:45.412Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"7a6aaaaf-7f8a-495a-9a66-4b6152eec242","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"a7e17912-c018-41f0-90b5-ebdb24f73bda","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01ANCoFC7LR8rePRxfG1nz4o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No, not login — that's overkill for this MVP.\n\nThe fix is simpler: when a buyer submits their phone number on `/consumer/orders`, only show orders that are already stored in **that browser's own localStorage** (from when they placed the order). No OTP, no account, no login.\n\nRight now the page queries Supabase directly with just the phone number — anyone who guesses or knows someone's number can see their orders.\n\nThe fix: cross-reference the phone input against the `yff_consumer_v1` localStorage key that's already written when someone places an order. If the phone matches what's saved locally, show orders. If not, show nothing (or a generic \"no orders found\").\n\nThis way:\n- Real buyers see their orders on their own phone/browser automatically\n- Random people typing someone else's number get nothing\n- Zero friction, zero login, zero OTP\n\nWant me to fix it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_read_input_tokens":163611,"output_tokens":208,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":208,"cache_read_input_tokens":163611,"cache_creation_input_tokens":453,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":453},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CajCeTXgQJHXTbNtD5a3h","type":"assistant","uuid":"97ec9dae-e046-49e4-b686-db0d8a2439a4","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:41:01.077Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"7a6aaaaf-7f8a-49