{"parentUuid":"c453b38b-55f2-46fd-8652-57cceec4556b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"33a3725d-7e1f-4225-b608-d0eb9876580b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":" Real buyers see their orders on their own phone/browser automatically. how only real buyers see their orders"},"uuid":"e7b5ef0f-a259-4bf4-b76b-64eadd4fc80f","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:41:54.879Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/veerendra/farmer/yourfamilyfarmer","sessionId":"7a6aaaaf-7f8a-495a-9a66-4b6152eec242","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"e7b5ef0f-a259-4bf4-b76b-64eadd4fc80f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01BzFQdyekNEkdj7JTKXh9Rk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Good question. Here's the logic:\n\nWhen a buyer places an order, the cart already writes their name + phone to `yff_consumer_v1` in localStorage (in `Cart.tsx`). That happens at order time on their device.\n\nSo on `/consumer/orders`:\n1. Read `yff_consumer_v1` from localStorage → get the phone number\n2. Auto-fill and auto-query with that phone — no manual input needed\n3. If someone manually types a **different** phone number, still only show results if it matches what's in localStorage\n\nSo a real buyer on their own phone → localStorage has their phone → orders load automatically.\n\nA stranger typing someone else's number → their localStorage has a different phone (or none) → query is blocked.\n\n---\n\n**The gap**: if someone clears localStorage or uses a different browser, they lose access to their order history. But for this use case — rural buyers on a single Android browser — that's acceptable. The farmer's WhatsApp message is the real confirmation anyway.\n\nWant me to implement it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_read_input_tokens":164064,"output_tokens":234,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":234,"cache_read_input_tokens":164064,"cache_creation_input_tokens":231,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":231},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CajCjbDB7BgM3qwSR5asb","type":"assistant","uuid":"419f7744-49ee-409f-bcfe-f5c53f15bb23","timestamp":"2026-05-05T09:42: